{"id":"0d09e544c417402c","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-regex-language-valuation.md","title":"以语言赋值的正则项语义","display":"df-regex-language-valuation — 以语言赋值的正则项语义","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-regex-language-valuation","aliases":["73-df-regex-language-valuation"],"display":"df-regex-language-valuation — 以语言赋值的正则项语义","depends_on":["[[73-df-regex-syntax]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§3.4.6–3.4.7, Theorem 3.13, print pp. 118–121; PDF pp. 140–143","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":3},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-regex-language-valuation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-regex-language-valuation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-regex-language-valuation — 以语言赋值的正则项语义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60152252105eae25\" href=\"?note=60152252105eae25\" title=\"73-df-regex-syntax\">73-df-regex-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§3.4.6–3.4.7, Theorem 3.13, print pp. 118–121; PDF pp. 140–143"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Sigma\">\\(X,\\Sigma\\)</span> 为字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\">\\(\\theta:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\)</span>；正则项取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RegExp}_X\">\\(\\mathsf{RegExp}_X\\)</span>，其字母构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf x\">\\(\\mathbf x\\)</span> 在本条充当语言变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,F\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_X\">\\(E,F\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta:\\mathsf{RegExp}_X\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(\\mathbf0)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(\\mathbf1)\\coloneqq\\{\\varepsilon\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(\\mathbf x)\\coloneqq\\theta(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta:\\mathsf{RegExp}_X\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(\\mathbf0)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(\\mathbf1)\\coloneqq\\{\\varepsilon\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(\\mathbf x)\\coloneqq\\theta(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E+F)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E)\\cup\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(F),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E\\cdot F)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E)\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(F),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E^\\star)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E)^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E+F)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E)\\cup\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(F),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E\\cdot F)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E)\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(F),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E^\\star)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E)^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>语言变量可被赋予非正则语言，代数律仍可讨论。语法树分解唯一，递归的子项严格变小，因此每个赋值给出唯一语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-regex-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"60152252105eae25","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-regex-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RegExp}_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf x","display":false},{"tex":"E,F\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_X","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta:\\mathsf{RegExp}_X\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(\\mathbf0)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(\\mathbf1)\\coloneqq\\{\\varepsilon\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(\\mathbf x)\\coloneqq\\theta(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E+F)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E)\\cup\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(F),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E\\cdot F)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E)\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(F),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E^\\star)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E)^*.","display":true}],"bytes":1744,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-regex-language-valuation|以语言赋值的正则项语义]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"73e86b7516dd1e83","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X$ 为字母表，$E,F\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_X$；赋值语义见 [[73-df-regex-language-valuation]]。量化的 $\\Sigma$ 为有限非空字母表，$\\theta:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)$。"}],"outgoing":["60152252105eae25","0a6da8c909717780"]}